    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Hi @echasnovski ! How do I correctly import and use luarocks packages with mini.deps?\r\nI found https://github.com/vhyrro/luarocks.nvim, is this the best method? If so, could you please add instructions on how to correctly install it using mini.deps?",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hi <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/echasnovski/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski\">@echasnovski</a> ! How do I correctly import and use luarocks packages with mini.deps?<br>\nI found <a href=\"https://github.com/vhyrro/luarocks.nvim\">https://github.com/vhyrro/luarocks.nvim</a>, is this the best method? If so, could you please add instructions on how to correctly install it using mini.deps?</p>",
    "bodyText": "Hi @echasnovski ! How do I correctly import and use luarocks packages with mini.deps?\nI found https://github.com/vhyrro/luarocks.nvim, is this the best method? If so, could you please add instructions on how to correctly install it using mini.deps?",
